 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Wheat for what is given at the division (As-Sa'di's wording, no side on whether it is obligatory), a house for the little ones left behind (no children drawn), coins for the orphans' wealth leaving before «نارا». Nothing for the Fire. STAGING v4: 8: the heirs sit at the division (home); relatives who do not inherit (8:4) and a poor man (8:7) arrive; the heirs give to both from it (8:8-9, Al-Muyassar: شيئا من المال), speak kindly (8:10) and the poor man raises his hands. Orphans are not drawn (no child figures). 9: the counterfactual of leaving weak offspring is not acted (house plate only, ended before the Name); the heirs bow on 9:11 (fear of Allah) and speak on 9:13 (right words). 10 stays ambient: the Fire."
 },
